# Cloudflare Workers static assets reads this file.
#
# The service worker and the manifest must never be served from a stale edge or
# browser cache. Everything else Vite emits is content-hashed and safe to cache
# hard, but these two keep their filenames forever, so a cached copy is how a
# phone gets stuck on an old worker and stops picking up new builds.
#
# no-cache does not mean "do not store". It means revalidate before use, which
# is exactly what is wanted: a 304 costs nothing on 2G, a stale worker costs
# the whole update.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
